{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythmatch is a town-building merge game with an anti-capitalist story. You play as aspiring goddess Artemis trying to find her place in Olympus. But when she is rejected and sent down to the mortal realm, she learns how her billionaire family negatively impacts the mortals. Instead of fighting for her place among the gods, she discovers the joys of working within a community and building relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5d3eea744a84b443cce2b88e925f78bb.poster.avif?t=1771416330\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5d3eea744a84b443cce2b88e925f78bb.webm?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5d3eea744a84b443cce2b88e925f78bb.mp4?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Artemis and help the women of Ithaca rebuild while the men take their sweet time returning from the Trojan War.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building a Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/434a83d2a654703f967cf144f562b648.poster.avif?t=1771416330\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/434a83d2a654703f967cf144f562b648.webm?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/434a83d2a654703f967cf144f562b648.mp4?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mortal Realm isn't where you expected to be, but it might be where you belong. Get to know the mortals and learn what community can look like and how you can be part of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Family to Un-Find</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.poster.avif?t=1771416330\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.webm?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.mp4?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artemis was born to be a Goddess, but in Olympus, the elitist gatekeeping runs rampant. Use your spite to fuel you and show them that you deserve a place in the pantheon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge the Gods</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.poster.avif?t=1771416330\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.webm?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.mp4?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythmatch features unique and replayable challenges with four of the Olympian gods. From clear-the-board puzzles to turn-based auto-battlers, these minigames will keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform well and you'll earn their favor, which will provide benefits back down in the Mortal Realm.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1778050?t=1771416330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/621a726a06a3ab65faedc5cbce6e52d7d3dece42/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771416330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/986fb8c978d3d02956c0a18db86b0d7bf778531e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771416330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/986fb8c978d3d02956c0a18db86b0d7bf778531e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771416330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2490290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythmatch is a town-building merge game with an anti-capitalist story. You play as aspiring goddess Artemis trying to find her place in Olympus. But when she is rejected and sent down to the mortal realm, she learns how her billionaire family negatively impacts the mortals. Instead of fighting for her place among the gods, she discovers the joys of working within a community and building relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5d3eea744a84b443cce2b88e925f78bb.poster.avif?t=1771416330\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5d3eea744a84b443cce2b88e925f78bb.webm?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5d3eea744a84b443cce2b88e925f78bb.mp4?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Artemis and help the women of Ithaca rebuild while the men take their sweet time returning from the Trojan War.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building a Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/434a83d2a654703f967cf144f562b648.poster.avif?t=1771416330\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/434a83d2a654703f967cf144f562b648.webm?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/434a83d2a654703f967cf144f562b648.mp4?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mortal Realm isn't where you expected to be, but it might be where you belong. Get to know the mortals and learn what community can look like and how you can be part of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Family to Un-Find</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.poster.avif?t=1771416330\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.webm?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/27217fc86ec18e0bb0c57f95308e0352.mp4?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artemis was born to be a Goddess, but in Olympus, the elitist gatekeeping runs rampant. Use your spite to fuel you and show them that you deserve a place in the pantheon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge the Gods</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.poster.avif?t=1771416330\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.webm?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/extras/5aac40f87a2f4663a45a190f2768104a.mp4?t=1771416330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mythmatch features unique and replayable challenges with four of the Olympian gods. From clear-the-board puzzles to turn-based auto-battlers, these minigames will keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform well and you'll earn their favor, which will provide benefits back down in the Mortal Realm.</p>","developers":["Team Artichoke"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1778050/61561781155771edbd448e2bbf15db091383c593